\description{
Filters rows on a family of ADaM-style indicator columns. Each chosen
column gets an include-style checkbox: ticked means "keep the rows carrying
this flag", unticked means \strong{no constraint from this column} -- never
"exclude them". Ticked boxes \strong{union}, so a family of period flags
(\code{PREFL} / \code{TRTEMFL} / \code{FUPFL}) answers "any of these periods" in one
control.
